### ----------------------
### API endpoints
### ----------------------

### Get installations
GET https://api.github.com/user/installations
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Authorization: Bearer {{github.access-token}}
X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2022-11-28

### Get installation repositories
GET https://api.github.com/user/installations/66038264/repositories
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Authorization: Bearer {{github.access-token}}
X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2022-11-28

### Get user
GET https://api.github.com/user
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Authorization: Bearer {{github.access-token}}
X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2022-11-28

### Get user repos
GET https://api.github.com/user/repos
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Authorization: Bearer {{github.access-token}}
X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2022-11-28

### Github: List webhooks
GET https://api.github.com/repos/exnota/exnota/hooks
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Authorization: Bearer {{github.access-token}}
X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2022-11-28

### Github: Get list of files
GET https://api.github.com/repos/mttschltz/exnota-docs/contents/tests/Data/Docs/OneLevel
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Authorization: Bearer {{github.access-token}}
X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2022-11-28


### Github: Get file
GET https://api.github.com/repos/mttschltz/exnota-docs/contents/tests/Data/Docs/OneLevel/README.md
Accept: application/vnd.github+json
Authorization: Bearer {{github.access-token}}
X-GitHub-Api-Version: 2022-11-28

